---
/**
 * Port of the old site's `service-notifications.html` `#ejemplo` live demo.
 * Verbatim markup and class names; used-selector CSS remapped to v2 tokens
 * under the `[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"]` root (design D3).
 * One guarded inline IIFE (D1/D4). RM: CSS-only (feature glow + alert
 * entrance + tooltip motion killed under prefers-reduced-motion, as on the
 * old site).
 * Directed adaptations: old CTAs dropped; 🔔/$/!/≡ replaces as placeholder
 * glyphs (→ "λ" feature tile, "$", "!", "#", "≡" alert icons); vendor SVG
 * logo strip → text chips (v2 chip pattern, names verbatim).
 */
---
<div class="example-inner" data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes">
    <span class="example-badge">Ejemplo en vivo</span>
    <h3 class="example-outcome">Cada evento crítico llega al instante, sin perseguirlo</h3>
    <p class="example-sub">Centro de notificaciones por evento: ventas y soporte reaccionan en minutos, no en días.</p>
    <ul class="example-kpis">
        <li>-35% tickets repetidos</li>
        <li>+98% entrega a tiempo</li>
        <li class="example-kpi-accent">Respuesta en minutos</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="example-sample-note">Datos de muestra con fines ilustrativos.</p>
    <div class="example-frame">
        <div class="example-frame-bar"><span class="example-frame-dot"></span><span class="example-frame-dot"></span><span class="example-frame-dot"></span><span class="example-frame-title">Centro de notificaciones</span></div>
        <div class="example-frame-body">
            <div class="example-featured" role="alert" tabindex="0" aria-describedby="tip-featured">
                <div class="example-featured-icon" aria-hidden="true">λ<span class="example-featured-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span></div>
                <div class="example-featured-content">
                    <p class="example-featured-title">Alerta destacada · ahora mismo</p>
                    <dl class="example-meta-grid">
                        <div><dt>Evento</dt><dd><code>pago_confirmado</code></dd></div>
                        <div><dt>Cliente</dt><dd>Distribuidora Andina</dd></div>
                    </dl>
                    <p class="example-featured-sub">Pedido #4821 por $1.240.000 · notificado por Email, WhatsApp y Slack en menos de 1 minuto.</p>
                </div>
                <span class="example-featured-live">En vivo</span>
                <div class="example-tip" id="tip-featured" role="tooltip"><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Canal · hora:</strong> Email, WhatsApp y Slack · ahora mismo</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Regla:</strong> Se envía al confirmarse el pago</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Estado:</strong> Entregado</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="example-tabs" role="tablist">
                <button type="button" class="example-tab example-tab-active" data-filter="all" aria-selected="true">Todas</button>
                <button type="button" class="example-tab" data-filter="ventas" aria-selected="false">Ventas</button>
                <button type="button" class="example-tab" data-filter="soporte" aria-selected="false">Soporte</button>
            </div>
            <ul class="example-alert-list">
                <li class="example-alert" data-cat="ventas" tabindex="0" aria-describedby="tip-alert-1"><div class="example-alert-icon example-alert-icon-success" aria-hidden="true">$</div><div class="example-alert-content"><p class="example-alert-title"><strong>Pedido #4821 pagado por $1.240.000</strong><span class="example-unread-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="example-new">Nuevo</span></p><dl class="example-meta-inline"><div><dt>Evento</dt><dd><code>pago_confirmado</code></dd></div><div><dt>Cliente</dt><dd>Distribuidora Andina</dd></div></dl><div class="example-alert-meta"><span class="example-channel">Email</span><span class="example-time">hace 2 min</span></div></div><div class="example-tip" id="tip-alert-1" role="tooltip"><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Canal · hora:</strong> Email · hace 2 min</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Regla:</strong> Se envía al confirmarse el pago</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Estado:</strong> Entregado</span></div></li>
                <li class="example-alert" data-cat="soporte" tabindex="0" aria-describedby="tip-alert-2"><div class="example-alert-icon example-alert-icon-warning" aria-hidden="true">!</div><div class="example-alert-content"><p class="example-alert-title"><strong>Stock bajo: Tinta CMYK &lt; 20 unidades</strong><span class="example-unread-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span></p><dl class="example-meta-inline"><div><dt>Evento</dt><dd><code>stock_bajo</code></dd></div><div><dt>Bodega</dt><dd>Bogotá Norte</dd></div></dl><div class="example-alert-meta"><span class="example-channel">Slack</span><span class="example-time">hace 18 min</span></div></div><div class="example-tip" id="tip-alert-2" role="tooltip"><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Canal · hora:</strong> Slack · hace 18 min</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Regla:</strong> Se envía cuando el stock baja de 20 unidades</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Estado:</strong> Entregado</span></div></li>
                <li class="example-alert" data-cat="ventas" tabindex="0" aria-describedby="tip-alert-3"><div class="example-alert-icon example-alert-icon-warning" aria-hidden="true">#</div><div class="example-alert-content"><p class="example-alert-title"><strong>Factura #1093 vencida hace 3 días</strong></p><dl class="example-meta-inline"><div><dt>Evento</dt><dd><code>factura_vencida</code></dd></div><div><dt>Detalle</dt><dd>Recordatorio automático enviado</dd></div></dl><div class="example-alert-meta"><span class="example-channel">WhatsApp</span><span class="example-time">hace 1 h</span></div></div><div class="example-tip" id="tip-alert-3" role="tooltip"><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Canal · hora:</strong> WhatsApp · hace 1 h</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Regla:</strong> Se envía a los 3 días de vencida la factura</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Estado:</strong> Entregado</span></div></li>
                <li class="example-alert" data-cat="soporte" tabindex="0" aria-describedby="tip-alert-4"><div class="example-alert-icon example-alert-icon-info" aria-hidden="true">≡</div><div class="example-alert-content"><p class="example-alert-title"><strong>Reporte diario de KPIs listo</strong></p><dl class="example-meta-inline"><div><dt>Evento</dt><dd><code>reporte_diario</code></dd></div><div><dt>Detalle</dt><dd>12 pedidos · 3 devoluciones</dd></div></dl><div class="example-alert-meta"><span class="example-channel">Email</span><span class="example-time">hoy 7:00 a. m.</span></div></div><div class="example-tip" id="tip-alert-4" role="tooltip"><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Canal · hora:</strong> Email · hoy 7:00 a. m.</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Regla:</strong> Se envía cada mañana a las 7:00 a. m.</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Estado:</strong> Programado</span></div></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="example-cta-row example-cta-box">
        <p class="example-channels-title">Conectamos tus notificaciones a múltiples canales</p>
        <ul class="example-channels">
            <li class="example-channel-item"><span>WhatsApp</span></li>
            <li class="example-channel-item"><span>Gmail</span></li>
            <li class="example-channel-item"><span>LinkedIn</span></li>
            <li class="example-channel-item"><span>Telegram</span></li>
            <li class="example-channel-item"><span>Slack</span></li>
            <li class="example-channel-item"><span>Outlook</span></li>
            <li class="example-channel-item"><span>Instagram</span></li>
            <li class="example-channel-item"><span>SMS</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="example-slogan">Dinos qué necesitas saber y haremos que se notifique de inmediato.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<style is:global>
/* Notifications demo — old demos.css used-selectors rebased from .live-example
   to [data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"], colors remapped to v2 tokens
   (design D3/D7). Pure-CSS tooltips; chips replace the vendor SVG strip (D6). */

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] {
    --demo-ok: #4ade80;
    --demo-warn: #fbbf24;
    --demo-danger: #f87171;
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto;
}

html[data-theme="light"] [data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] {
    --demo-ok: #15803d;
    --demo-warn: #b45309;
    --demo-danger: #b91c1c;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text);
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 50px;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] h3.example-outcome {
    font-size: 1.9rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-sub {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    max-width: 700px;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-kpis {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-kpis li {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 50px;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    white-space: nowrap;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-kpis li.example-kpi-accent {
    background: var(--primary-text);
    color: var(--bg);
    border-color: var(--primary-text);
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-sample-note {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0 0 28px;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-frame {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: visible;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    text-align: left;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-frame-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background: var(--card);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 12px 18px;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-frame-dot {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--muted);
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-frame-dot:first-child { background: var(--primary); }
[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-frame-dot:nth-child(2) { background: var(--primary); }
[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-frame-dot:nth-child(3) { background: var(--primary); }

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-frame-title {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-left: 8px;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-frame-body {
    padding: 20px;
}

/* Featured alert: old navy→blue gradient card → filled primary pair (D3). */
[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-featured {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    background: var(--primary-text);
    border: 2px solid var(--primary);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary-text) 18%, transparent), var(--shadow);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 22px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    color: var(--bg);
    animation: demo-notif-feat-glow 3.2s ease-in-out infinite;
}

@keyframes demo-notif-feat-glow {
    0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary-text) 18%, transparent), var(--shadow); }
    50% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary-text) 26%, transparent), var(--shadow); }
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-featured:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--text);
    outline-offset: 2px;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-featured-icon {
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--bg);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    position: relative;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-featured-check {
    position: absolute;
    right: -6px;
    bottom: -6px;
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--demo-ok);
    color: var(--bg);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border: 2px solid var(--primary-text);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-featured-content {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-featured-title {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--bg);
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-meta-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
    margin: 12px 0 10px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 12%, transparent);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 22%, transparent);
    border-radius: 12px;
    max-width: 440px;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-meta-grid > div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 90px 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-meta-grid dt {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 85%, transparent);
    line-height: 1.4;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-meta-grid dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--bg);
    line-height: 1.45;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-meta-grid dd code {
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--bg);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 16%, transparent);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 22%, transparent);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 3px 8px;
    white-space: nowrap;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-featured-sub {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 85%, transparent);
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-featured-live {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--bg);
    background: var(--demo-ok);
    border-radius: 50px;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    white-space: nowrap;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-tabs {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-tab {
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 50px;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-tab[aria-selected="true"],
[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-tab.example-tab-active {
    background: var(--primary-text);
    color: var(--bg);
    border-color: var(--primary-text);
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-alert-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-alert {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 14px;
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 14px 14px 14px 20px;
    overflow: visible;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
    animation: demo-notif-alert-in 0.45s ease both;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-alert-list > li:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.06s; }
[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-alert-list > li:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.12s; }
[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-alert-list > li:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.18s; }

@keyframes demo-notif-alert-in {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-alert:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary-text) 25%, transparent);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-alert:focus-visible,
[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-featured:focus-within {
    outline: 2px solid var(--primary-text);
    outline-offset: 2px;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-alert::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 5px;
    border-radius: 16px 0 0 16px;
    background: var(--border);
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-alert[data-cat="ventas"]::before {
    background: var(--demo-ok);
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-alert[data-cat="soporte"]::before {
    background: var(--primary-text);
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-alert-icon {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 800;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-alert-icon-success {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--demo-ok) 14%, var(--card));
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--demo-ok) 35%, transparent);
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-alert-icon-warning {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--demo-warn) 14%, var(--card));
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--demo-warn) 40%, transparent);
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-alert-icon-info {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary-text) 14%, var(--card));
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary-text) 30%, transparent);
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-alert-content {
    min-width: 0;
    flex: 1;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-alert-title {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 0 0 3px;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-alert-title strong {
    display: inline;
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.35;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-alert-content strong {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text);
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-alert-content span {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--muted);
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-unread-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--primary);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary) 18%, transparent);
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-new {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-size: 0.66rem !important;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.4px;
    color: var(--demo-ok) !important;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--demo-ok) 12%, var(--card));
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--demo-ok) 35%, transparent);
    border-radius: 50px;
    padding: 2px 9px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    white-space: nowrap;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-alert-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--muted);
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-channel {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--primary-text);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary-text) 10%, var(--card));
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary-text) 15%, transparent);
    border-radius: 50px;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    white-space: nowrap;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-time {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    white-space: nowrap;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-meta-inline {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    column-gap: 10px;
    row-gap: 4px;
    margin: 4px 0 2px;
    padding: 0;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-meta-inline > div {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 6px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-meta-inline > div + div::before {
    content: "·";
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-right: 10px;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-meta-inline dt {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.6px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    white-space: nowrap;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-meta-inline dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.45;
}

[data-demo="notificaciones-inteligentes"] .example-meta-inline dd code {
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--primary-text);
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 1px 6px;
    white-space: nowrap;
}

